I've been making a web comics link page of the comics
I read myself (I have 1200 bookmarked, the page is
going to take months).

Lots of web comic sites don't _have_ link icons, and
almost none have them in my choice of pixel heights,
(50) so I end up making or modifying icons for almost
every site to which I want to provide a link.

Habitually, I send a copy of the icon off to the sites
that didn't have such an icon at all.

I've gotten back lots of promises to use that received
icon, but now rgrn's own Roger Barnett has carried
through (promptly) and posted the link icon I made
for him at the bottom of his Angband -- Tales from
the Pit links page.

